{ps_beta.array}") # get a slice of `beta` to retrieve the first three bits beta_sl_bits = data.beta.slice_bits([0, 1, 2]) print( f"The shape of `beta` after bit-wise slicing is {beta_sl_bits.array.shape}." ) print(f"The bytes in `beta` after bit-wise slicing:
